        "why": "ical.js gives 29 February 1896 and 1904 and skips 1900, a common year (RFC 5545 §3.3.10: an invalid date is ignored). libical's own rule iterator gives the same days (the rule days agree), but its listing converts times to seconds since 1970, which libical defines only from 1902-01-01, so with a window that starts before 1902 it lists nothing."
